Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,But one last thing, because\Nthat was one case that I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.86,0:00:02.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,saw,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:07.51,Cap,,0,0,0,,What is your favorite, most\Ninteresting case that you've
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.51,0:00:08.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,seen?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:09.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:13.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,There's a guy, he actually\Nruns one of the country
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.96,0:00:16.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,up here, and he was, I think
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.44,0:00:19.63,Cap,,0,0,0,,he'll be okay with me\Ntelling his story, but he
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.63,0:00:21.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,bachelor with a group of\Nguys
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.28,0:00:26.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,on a guy's trip in\NNashville, and he got hit by
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.22,0:00:28.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,driver, and he got his arm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.56,0:00:29.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,crushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.56,0:00:32.63,Cap,,0,0,0,,destroyed, and he was at\NVanderbilt Medical Center,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.63,0:00:34.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,he said you could get\Nemergency
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.36,0:00:37.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,surgery here, or there's a\Nfriend of mine who lives in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.98,0:00:39.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,Palm Beach who you could\Ncome
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.92,0:00:43.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,and go see, and ironically\Nit was me, and he had
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.33,0:00:45.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,looked it up and made an\Nappointment
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.52,0:00:48.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,and came in, and this guy\Nsaid it was meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.40,0:00:52.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,He flew back, and he had\Nprobably one of the most
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.05,0:00:54.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,difficult, blasted elbows\Nyou've
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.44,0:00:57.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,ever seen, and he had nerve\Ndamage, severe nerve damage,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.50,0:00:58.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,and imagine he's a country
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.92,0:01:02.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,club manager does everything\Nand he's actually worked
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.76,0:01:05.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,with Tiger Woods and so a\Nreally great
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.52,0:01:08.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,human being who really\Ndidn't ask for this to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.56,0:01:11.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,A year later, so we went\Nthrough a single surgery,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.52,0:01:13.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,surgery didn't heal, still\Nhad
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.16,0:01:16.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,nerve damage severe, the\Nmost optimistic guy I've
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.96,0:01:17.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,met.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.24,0:01:21.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,We took him back for a\Nrevision surgery and six
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.16,0:01:22.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,later back he's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.68,0:01:25.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,He has full function back,\Nhe got his nerve damage
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.49,0:01:27.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,turned around with the\Nrevision surgery
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.68,0:01:29.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,which he never thought would\Nhappen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.24,0:01:31.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Six months he waited\Nnothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.40,0:01:33.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,And now he's got his full\Nelbow function.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:35.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,And he sort of said, you\Nknow, we joke,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.76,0:01:37.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,but we gave him his life\Nback.
